      "content": "it's weird because people always talk about \"hope\" or \"finding purpose\" like it's some objective truth, but it feels more like just a coping mechanism to ignore the reality of it all. if the only thing i can actually control is whether or not i keep participating in this, then isn't wanting to quit just... the most honest response to the situation?",
